1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,860
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) Howard goes to a backpack store.

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:05,940
He likes the red backpack.

3
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:09,000
He looks at the tag.

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,980
The backpack is $40.

5
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:16,540
He asks the cashier if he can lower

6
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:17,280
the price.

7
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:20,900
I will sell it to you for $39.

8
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:24,120
Howard shakes his head.

9
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:28,980
How about $30, and I tell my friends

10
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:29,840
to come here?

11
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:33,560
The cashier agrees to that deal.
